'''Wingman Skree''' is one of the [[aviansie]] bodyguards of [[Kree'arra]], along with [[Flight Kilisa]] and [[Flockleader Geerin]]. He uses magic attacks with a max hit of 16 [[hitpoints]]. He wears what appears to be a modified set of the [[Armadyl armour]] dropped by Kree'arra and his bodyguards.

The ability to be assigned aviansie by [[Konar quo Maten]], [[Chaeldar]], [[Nieve]], and [[Duradel]] can be purchased for 80 [[slayer reward point]]s, which allows the use for the bonuses of the [[slayer helmet (i)]].

